## Use

```python
from gen_2310_16463 import DIFFICULTY, make_instance, render, verify

inst = make_instance(seed=19, **DIFFICULTY["medium"])
assert verify(inst, inst["answer"]) == (True, "ok")
prompt = render(inst)
```

