+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: the Introduction's unique-decoding result permits the "
+        "Berlekamp-Welch algorithm, O(N^3) field operations; the measured operation "
+        "count and wall clock at the shipping preset are recorded by selftest, while "
+        "the orbit route takes at most 110 exact field operations."
