Claude solved the hinted medium instance. Because easy already failed G9(b) and the permitted one-rung move to medium also dissolved under the hint, this family must be rejected under the stated protocol. I’m preserving the script-owned evidence and will document the exact Track B costs and theorem sections rather than retuning again.
